    criteria: 'A Flanker at 8 m has just taken a full-draw Hardpoint arrow on a WEAK POINT, frozen 60 ms after '
      + 'impact. PASS requires ALL of: (1) a bright hot-orange SPARK BURST at the impact point whose spread is at '
